 <h3><u>Meda Wada</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-IN font-family:tahoma,sans-serif;color:#333333;background:white>Meda Wada Hey Wal Na Rosan 4x</span><span lang=EN-IN 115%;font-family:tahoma,sans-serif;color:#333333><br> <span ladli haan main babay di 2x< pan><br> <span sun behan di a faryad aey< pan><br> <span dardan da darmane ho sar babay miwa dey<span class=apple-converted-space>&nbsp;</span></span><br> <span wari sar meku babay da sajjad (a.s) bhira milwa aey meda wada hay wal na rosan 2x< pan><br> <br> <span peyu mazloom de hik wari< pan><br> <span zara chumwa aey meda wada hay wal na rosan< pan><br> <span wari sar meku babay da sajjad (a.s) bhira milwa aey meda wada hay wal na rosan 2x< pan><br> <span <span class=textexposedshow>Meku Khaak Te Nendar Nai Andi Jadah Sivndi Haan Kan Dukh Wainday</span><span class=apple-converted-space>&nbsp;</span><br> <span class=textexposedshow>Meku Shimmar (L.a) Tamachay Maray Hirh 2x</span><br> <span class=textexposedshow>Meday Rukhsar Gawah Aey Meda Wada Aey Wal Na Rosan</span><br> <span class=textexposedshow>Hik Wari Sar Meku Babay Da Sajjad (A.s) Bhira Milwa aey Meda Wada Hay Wal Na Rosan 2x</span><br> <br> <span class=textexposedshow>Chaow Salan Di Masooma De Nai Sir De Waal Safaid Honday</span><br> <span class=textexposedshow>Main Waang Zaeefan Ho Gaiyan 2x</span><br> <span class=textexposedshow>Gaya Dukh Babay Da Khaa Aey Meda Wada Aey Wal Na Rosan</span><br> <span class=textexposedshow>Hik Wari Sar Meku Babay Da Sajjad (A.s) Bhira Milwa aey Meda Wada Hay Wal Na Rosan 2x</span><br> <br> <span class=textexposedshow>Main Peyu Di Matam Daar Jadah Zindan e Shaam Ich Mar Waisan</span><br> <span class=textexposedshow>Meku Dafan Kary Sajjad (A.s) Bhira 2x</span><br> <span class=textexposedshow>Aeho Maila Choola Paa Aey Meda Wada Aey Wal Na Rosan</span><br> <span class=textexposedshow>Hik Wari Sar Meku Babay Da Sajjad (A.s) Bhira Milwa aey Meda Wada Hay Wal Na Rosan 2x</span><br> <br> <span class=textexposedshow>Kya Haal Dasan Bakir Jewi Meku Shaam Di Garmi Kha Gai Aey</span><br> <span class=textexposedshow>Meku Girrh Wanj Is Zindan Vichon 2x</span><br> <span class=textexposedshow>Nai Lagdi Veer Hawa Aey Meda Wada Aey Wal Na Rosan</span><br> <span class=textexposedshow>Hik Wari Sar Meku Babay Da Sajjad (A.s) Bhira Milwa aey Meda Wada Hay Wal Na Rosan 2x</span><br> <br> <span class=textexposedshow>Tu Sar babay Da Wanj Girrh Aah Shallah Rat Akhiyan Di Band Thirri</span><br> <span class=textexposedshow>Jey Peyu Da Sar Meku Na Milya 2x</span><br> <span class=textexposedshow>Wal Muk Waisar Meday Saaye Meda Wada Aey Wal Na Rosan</span><br> <span class=textexposedshow>Hik Wari Sar Meku Babay Da Sajjad (A.s) Bhira Milwa aey Meda Wada Hay Wal Na Rosan 2x</span><br> <br> <span class=textexposedshow>Meku Peyu Mazloom De Hik Wari 2x</span><br> <span class=textexposedshow>Rukhsaar Zara Chumwa Aey Meda Wada Aey Wal Na Rosan</span><br> <span class=textexposedshow>Hik Wari Sar Meku Babay Da Sajjad (A.s) Bhira Milwa aey Meda Wada Hay Wal Na Rosan 2x</span><br> <br> <span class=textexposedshow>By: Syed Shabih ul Hassan Kazmi (Mash'hadi)</span></span></span><a name=_GoBack></a></span></span></span></span></p>
